// Tabards: the 1.12 tabard looks, sold in the shop (Shop, Tabards tab) for points to spend. A
// tabard bought is the whole warband's; each hero wears one (or none), picked on its hero sheet
// (Equipment), over any armour look, at the camp fire and in runs. docs/game/achievements.md has
// the rules, docs/game/AUTHORING.md "A tabard" how to add one. An id is kept in the save once
// shipped: never change one.
//
// look: Neutral(display)                 one look, any hero may wear it
//       Faction(horde: d, alliance: d)   a pair sold as one: each hero shows its own faction's
//       Only(faction: F, display: d)     only that faction's heroes may wear it
// Every display is an ItemDisplayInfo.dbc id of the 1.12.1 client (its chest textures checked),
// the item named after it in the comment. The Officer's Tabards are
// left out (their looks are the Knight's Colors' and the Stone Guard's Herald's); Lordaeron and
// Darkmoon added; the pairs swap by faction; a faction's own tabard only for its heroes.
// Prices: drafts (2026-10-27): the simple ones 15, the rest 30 (2026-10-30:
// steps of 15, 30 and 50, from 25 and 50).
([
    // ---------------------------------------------------------------- 25 points
    (
        id: "stormwind",
        name: "Tabard of Stormwind",
        icon: "INV_Shirt_GuildTabard_01",
        look: Only(faction: Alliance, display: 21338), // item 11364
        price: 15, // draft
        text: "The lion of Stormwind, worn by those who keep its gate.",
    ),
    (
